{"seq":2,"slug":"image-preprocessing","title":"图像预处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/image-fundamentals/image-preprocessing","wordCount":2014,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"图像预处理\">图像预处理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图像预处理是将原始图像转换为适合模型输入的标准化数据的过程。预处理的质量直接影响下游任务的精度和训练稳定性。从简单的尺寸调整到复杂的自适应滤波，预处理涵盖了图像在进入神经网络前的所有变换操作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[原始图像] --&gt; B[几何变换]&#10;    B --&gt; C[灰度/色彩调整]&#10;    C --&gt; D[噪声抑制]&#10;    D --&gt; E[边缘增强]&#10;    E --&gt; F[归一化]&#10;    F --&gt; G[模型输入]\">graph LR\n    A[原始图像] --&gt; B[几何变换]\n    B --&gt; C[灰度/色彩调整]\n    C --&gt; D[噪声抑制]\n    D --&gt; E[边缘增强]\n    E --&gt; F[归一化]\n    F --&gt; G[模型输入]</pre><p>预处理管线需要根据具体任务和数据特点进行定制。关键原则是：训练和推理阶段必须使用完全相同的预处理流程，否则会导致训练-推理不一致（train-test skew），严重影响模型性能。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预处理操作</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Resize</td>\n<td>统一输入尺寸</td>\n<td>所有任务</td>\n<td>保持宽高比，选择插值方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Normalization</td>\n<td>数值范围标准化</td>\n<td>所有深度学习任务</td>\n<td>匹配预训练统计量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高斯模糊</td>\n<td>平滑噪声</td>\n<td>噪声图像，预滤波</td>\n<td>核大小影响细节保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直方图均衡</td>\n<td>增强对比度</td>\n<td>光照不均，低对比度</td>\n<td>CLAHE 优于全局均衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘检测</td>\n<td>提取轮廓信息</td>\n<td>特征工程，辅助输入</td>\n<td>Canny 阈值需调优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仿射变换</td>\n<td>校正几何畸变</td>\n<td>文档矫正，卫星图像</td>\n<td>需要对应点或参数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"几何变换与尺寸调整\">几何变换与尺寸调整</h2><p>几何变换改变图像的空间排列而不改变像素值本身。最常见的操作包括缩放、旋转、翻转、裁剪和仿射变换。在深度学习中，缩放是最频繁使用的几何变换，因为模型通常要求固定的输入尺寸。</p>\n<p>缩放操作的核心是插值算法。当目标尺寸大于原始尺寸时需要上采样（插值），反之需要下采样（抽取）。不同插值方法在速度和质量之间有不同的权衡。最近邻插值速度最快但会产生锯齿；双线性插值是最常用的折中方案；双三次插值质量最高但计算量大。对于分割任务的标签图（label map），必须使用最近邻插值以保持类别索引的整数性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import cv2&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;img = cv2.imread(&quot;input.jpg&quot;)&#10;&#10;resized_bilinear = cv2.resize(img, (224, 224), interpolation=cv2.INTER_LINEAR)&#10;resized_area = cv2.resize(img, (224, 224), interpolation=cv2.INTER_AREA)&#10;&#10;h, w = img.shape[:2]&#10;scale = 224 / max(h, w)&#10;new_h, new_w = int(h * scale), int(w * scale)&#10;resized = cv2.resize(img, (new_w, new_h))&#10;padded = np.zeros((224, 224, 3), dtype=np.uint8) + 114&#10;offset_y = (224 - new_h) // 2&#10;offset_x = (224 - new_w) // 2&#10;padded[offset_y:offset_y+new_h, offset_x:offset_x+new_w] = resized\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">img </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.imread(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input.jpg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">resized_bilinear </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.resize(img, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">interpolation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">INTER_LINEAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">resized_area </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.resize(img, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">interpolation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">INTER_AREA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h, w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> img.shape[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 224</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(h, w)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">new_h, new_w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scale), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scale)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">resized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.resize(img, (new_w, new_h))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">padded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.uint8) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 114</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">offset_y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_h) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">offset_x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_w) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">padded[offset_y:offset_y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">new_h, offset_x:offset_x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">new_w] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resized</span></span></code></pre></div><p>保持宽高比的缩放（letterbox）在目标检测中非常重要。直接拉伸图像会改变目标的宽高比，导致检测框回归不准确。letterbox 方法先等比缩放再填充灰边，确保目标形状不变形。YOLO 系列模型普遍采用这种方式。</p>\n<p>仿射变换和透视变换是更通用的几何变换。仿射变换保持平行关系，适用于旋转、缩放、错切等操作；透视变换可以校正拍摄角度导致的梯形畸变，在文档扫描和车牌识别中广泛使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滤波与噪声抑制\">滤波与噪声抑制</h2><p>图像采集过程中不可避免地引入噪声，如传感器热噪声、光子散粒噪声等。滤波操作通过局部或全局的像素值重组来抑制噪声、平滑图像或增强特定频率成分。</p>\n<p>线性滤波使用固定的卷积核对图像进行卷积运算。高斯滤波是最常用的平滑滤波器，其核权重服从高斯分布，σ 参数控制平滑程度。均值滤波对核区域内所有像素取平均，计算简单但容易模糊边缘。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import cv2&#10;&#10;img = cv2.imread(&quot;noisy.jpg&quot;)&#10;&#10;gaussian = cv2.GaussianBlur(img, (5, 5), sigmaX=1.0)&#10;median = cv2.medianBlur(img, 5)&#10;bilateral = cv2.bilateralFilter(img, d=9, sigmaColor=75, sigmaSpace=75)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">img </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.imread(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"noisy.jpg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gaussian </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.GaussianBlur(img, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sigmaX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">median </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.medianBlur(img, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bilateral </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.bilateralFilter(img, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sigmaColor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sigmaSpace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>中值滤波是非线性滤波器，取核区域的中值作为输出。它对椒盐噪声（脉冲噪声）有很好的抑制效果，同时比高斯滤波更能保持边缘清晰度。双边滤波同时考虑空间距离和像素值差异，在平滑区域进行平滑的同时保持边缘锐利，是保边去噪的经典方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 线性滤波&#10;        A[均值滤波] --&gt; D[平滑但模糊边缘]&#10;        B[高斯滤波] --&gt; E[加权平滑]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 非线性滤波&#10;        C[中值滤波] --&gt; F[去椒盐噪声保边缘]&#10;        G[双边滤波] --&gt; H[保边平滑]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 深度学习去噪&#10;        I[DnCNN] --&gt; J[学习噪声残差]&#10;        K[NAFNet] --&gt; L[端到端去噪]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 线性滤波\n        A[均值滤波] --&gt; D[平滑但模糊边缘]\n        B[高斯滤波] --&gt; E[加权平滑]\n    end\n    subgraph 非线性滤波\n        C[中值滤波] --&gt; F[去椒盐噪声保边缘]\n        G[双边滤波] --&gt; H[保边平滑]\n    end\n    subgraph 深度学习去噪\n        I[DnCNN] --&gt; J[学习噪声残差]\n        K[NAFNet] --&gt; L[端到端去噪]\n    end</pre><p>在深度学习时代，基于神经网络的去噪方法（如 DnCNN、NAFNet）已经超越了传统滤波器的效果。这些模型可以学习复杂的噪声模式，处理传统方法难以应对的真实场景噪声。但在数据预处理管线中，传统滤波仍然因为速度快、无需训练而广泛使用。</p>\n<p>频域滤波通过傅里叶变换将图像从空间域转换到频率域，然后设计频率响应函数进行滤波。低通滤波器抑制高频噪声，高通滤波器增强边缘和细节。在实际工程中，空间域卷积和频域滤波可以互换，但卷积核较大时频域方法计算效率更高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对比度增强与直方图处理\">对比度增强与直方图处理</h2><p>对比度增强旨在改善图像的视觉质量和特征可区分性。在光照不均匀、低对比度等场景下，适当的对比度增强可以显著提升模型性能。</p>\n<p>直方图均衡化是最经典的对比度增强方法。它通过重新映射像素值使输出图像的灰度直方图趋于均匀分布，从而扩展动态范围。全局直方图均衡化对整幅图像使用相同的映射函数，在局部对比度不一致的场景下效果有限。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import cv2&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;gray = cv2.imread(&quot;dark_image.jpg&quot;, cv2.IMREAD_GRAYSCALE)&#10;equalized = cv2.equalizeHist(gray)&#10;&#10;clahe = cv2.createCLAHE(clipLimit=2.0, tileGridSize=(8, 8))&#10;enhanced = clahe.apply(gray)&#10;&#10;img_color = cv2.imread(&quot;dark_image.jpg&quot;)&#10;lab = cv2.cvtColor(img_color, cv2.COLOR_BGR2Lab)&#10;l, a, b = cv2.split(lab)&#10;l_enhanced = clahe.apply(l)&#10;enhanced_color = cv2.merge([l_enhanced, a, b])&#10;enhanced_color = cv2.cvtColor(enhanced_color, cv2.COLOR_Lab2BGR)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gray </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.imread(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dark_image.jpg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">IMREAD_GRAYSCALE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">equalized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.equalizeHist(gray)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">clahe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.createCLAHE(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">clipLimit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tileGridSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">enhanced </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clahe.apply(gray)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">img_color </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.imread(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dark_image.jpg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.cvtColor(img_color, cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COLOR_BGR2Lab</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">l, a, b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.split(lab)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">l_enhanced </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clahe.apply(l)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">enhanced_color </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.merge([l_enhanced, a, b])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">enhanced_color </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.cvtColor(enhanced_color, cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COLOR_Lab2BGR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CLAHE（对比度受限自适应直方图均衡化）解决了全局均衡的局限。它将图像分成小块分别进行直方图均衡，同时通过 clipLimit 参数限制对比度放大的上限，避免噪声过度放大。CLAHE 在医学影像、夜间场景等低对比度数据的预处理中效果显著。</p>\n<p>Gamma 校正通过幂函数 <code>output = input^γ</code> 调整图像亮度。γ &lt; 1 使暗部变亮（提亮），γ &gt; 1 使亮部变暗（压暗）。自适应 Gamma 校正可以根据图像的整体亮度自动选择 γ 值，是一种简单有效的亮度归一化方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边缘检测与形态学操作\">边缘检测与形态学操作</h2><p>边缘检测提取图像中亮度突变的区域，是传统计算机视觉中最重要的底层操作之一。虽然深度学习可以端到端学习特征，但边缘信息作为辅助输入仍然能提升模型在结构化场景中的表现。</p>\n<p>Sobel 算子通过一阶导数近似检测水平和垂直方向的边缘。Laplacian 算子使用二阶导数同时检测所有方向的边缘，但对噪声更加敏感。Canny 边缘检测是最常用的多阶段边缘检测算法，它结合高斯平滑、梯度计算、非极大值抑制和双阈值连接，能够产生细而连续的边缘线。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import cv2&#10;&#10;gray = cv2.imread(&quot;input.jpg&quot;, cv2.IMREAD_GRAYSCALE)&#10;&#10;sobel_x = cv2.Sobel(gray, cv2.CV_64F, 1, 0, ksize=3)&#10;sobel_y = cv2.Sobel(gray, cv2.CV_64F, 0, 1, ksize=3)&#10;sobel_mag = cv2.magnitude(sobel_x, sobel_y)&#10;&#10;edges = cv2.Canny(gray, threshold1=50, threshold2=150)&#10;&#10;kernel = cv2.getStructuringElement(cv2.MORPH_RECT, (5, 5))&#10;dilated = cv2.dilate(edges, kernel, iterations=1)&#10;closed = cv2.morphologyEx(edges, cv2.MORPH_CLOSE, kernel)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gray </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.imread(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input.jpg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">IMREAD_GRAYSCALE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sobel_x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.Sobel(gray, cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CV_64F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ksize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sobel_y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.Sobel(gray, cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CV_64F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ksize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sobel_mag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.magnitude(sobel_x, sobel_y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">edges </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.Canny(gray, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">threshold1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">threshold2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kernel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.getStructuringElement(cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MORPH_RECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dilated </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.dilate(edges, kernel, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">iterations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">closed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.morphologyEx(edges, cv2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MORPH_CLOSE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, kernel)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>形态学操作基于结构元素对二值或灰度图像进行集合运算。膨胀扩展前景区域，腐蚀缩小前景区域，开运算（先腐蚀后膨胀）去除小噪点，闭运算（先膨胀后腐蚀）填充小孔洞。形态学操作在掩码后处理、连通区域分析和文档图像处理中广泛使用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>膨胀</td>\n<td>扩大白色区域</td>\n<td>连接断裂边缘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>腐蚀</td>\n<td>缩小白色区域</td>\n<td>去除细小噪点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开运算</td>\n<td>去噪点保形状</td>\n<td>清理二值分割结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闭运算</td>\n<td>填孔洞保轮廓</td>\n<td>填充分割空洞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形态学梯度</td>\n<td>提取边界</td>\n<td>获取目标轮廓</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((图像预处理))&#10;    几何变换&#10;      缩放与插值&#10;      Letterbox 保持宽高比&#10;      仿射与透视变换&#10;    滤波去噪&#10;      高斯滤波&#10;      中值滤波&#10;      双边滤波&#10;      深度学习去噪&#10;    对比度增强&#10;      直方图均衡化&#10;      CLAHE 自适应增强&#10;      Gamma 校正&#10;    边缘与形态学&#10;      Sobel/Canny 边缘检测&#10;      膨胀/腐蚀&#10;      开闭运算\">mindmap\n  root((图像预处理))\n    几何变换\n      缩放与插值\n      Letterbox 保持宽高比\n      仿射与透视变换\n    滤波去噪\n      高斯滤波\n      中值滤波\n      双边滤波\n      深度学习去噪\n    对比度增强\n      直方图均衡化\n      CLAHE 自适应增强\n      Gamma 校正\n    边缘与形态学\n      Sobel/Canny 边缘检测\n      膨胀/腐蚀\n      开闭运算</pre><ul>\n<li>几何变换中缩放最为常见，保持宽高比的 letterbox 方法在检测任务中至关重要</li>\n<li>滤波选择取决于噪声类型：高斯噪声用高斯滤波，椒盐噪声用中值滤波，保边场景用双边滤波</li>\n<li>CLAHE 是最实用的对比度增强方法，在低对比度图像预处理中效果显著</li>\n<li>边缘检测和形态学操作在后处理和辅助特征生成中仍有重要价值</li>\n<li>预处理管线必须保证训练和推理一致，否则会引入 train-test skew</li>\n<li>现代框架（如 torchvision.transforms）提供了便捷的预处理组合接口</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图像预处理","id":"图像预处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"几何变换与尺寸调整","id":"几何变换与尺寸调整"},{"level":2,"text":"滤波与噪声抑制","id":"滤波与噪声抑制"},{"level":2,"text":"对比度增强与直方图处理","id":"对比度增强与直方图处理"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘检测与形态学操作","id":"边缘检测与形态学操作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数字图像表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/image-fundamentals/digital-image-representation"},"next":{"title":"特征提取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/image-fundamentals/feature-extraction"}}